**You may** read, compile and run it for personal learning, and quote small portions with attribution.

**You may NOT** (1) use it commercially in any form — selling it, bundling it into a commercial product, using it in paid services, or monetizing it through ads/traffic; (2) use it for any illegal activity, including distributing or obtaining unlawful content, infringing intellectual property, spreading malware, or attacking networks; (3) remove this notice.

**Disclaimer.** THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. It is merely a BitTorrent protocol client and hosts, indexes and distributes no content. **You bear sole responsibility and all legal liability for how you use it.** The authors and contributors accept no liability whatsoever for any loss, legal dispute or claim arising from its use.

If you do not agree with any of the above, stop using the software and delete all copies immediately.
